"First, add the `quarkus-assistant-deployment-spi` to the *deployment* module "
"of your extension:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Next, produce a `AssistantConsoleBuildItem` in a `@BuildStep`:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This is the description that appears in the Assistant section of the log "
"menu."
msgstr ""

msgid "This is the keyboard shortcut that triggers the assistant function."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When added, this will result in a new entry under the `Assistant` heading in "
"the log shortcut menu:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"When the user presses `@`, the Dev Assistant is invoked and responds in the "
"log:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This feature provides a simple and delightful way to offer quick-access AI "
"actions through the Quarkus log."
msgstr ""

msgid "Feedback"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The Dev Assistant is evolving! If it gives incorrect answers or misses "
"something obvious, please report it at:"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues"
msgstr ""
